  | (Legend), Merge
  | (Variable Name), Picture
  | (File Name), Table (Name
  | for Table of Tables),
  | Whitespace (Size
  | (vertical))
Not a valid number | Keycap (Foreground, | The text of a number
 (Field) | Background, Scale), Line | field is not a number.  A
  | (Length, Weight, | number is digits, and a
  | Center), Picture (Width, | decimal point where the
  | Height, Scale), | field has decimals; no
  | Whitespace (Size | sign, no letters and no
  | (vertical)); the name of | more decimals than the
  | the field is in the | field has (none for
  | parentheses | Center, one for
  |  | the shades of a keycap,
  |  | three for the others).
