FIELD must be 0.0 to | Keycap (Foreground, | The shade is less than 0.0
 100.0 | Background) | or more than 100.0.  FIELD
  |  | is the name of the field.
  |  | Type a shade in that range.
Scale must be 0.001 | Keycap (Scale) | The scale is less than 0.001
 to 10.000 |  | or more than 10.  Type a
  |  | scale in that range.
Counter must be 1 to | Counter (Counter (1-99)) | The number of the counter
 99 |  | is not a whole number
  |  | from 1 to 99.  Type a
  |  | number in that range.
Set Value must be 0 to | Counter (Set Value) | The Set Value is not a
 4294967295 |  | whole number from 0 to
